      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey can u help me write a quick backgrounder for a briefing? i need a summary of why the new multilateral trade agreement being discussed in the UN is such a big deal for the next decade. just a few paragraphs on the main drivers and why most economists think it's necessary for stability.",
